---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Banner from '../components/Banner.astro';
import FeatureCard from '../components/FeatureCard.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Behind the Corner" description="A place to explore and learn about various topics that spark curiosity.">
  
  <section>
    <h1>Maanhaar Magic Beard Oil</h1>
    <p>A real beard can take a beating from the Karoo sun and farm dust, but it shouldn't feel like a wire brush. We made Maanhaar Magic to soften up the coarsest facial hair without taking away your edge.</p>
    
    <h3>What's inside?</h3>
    <p>We skip the filler and use eight hard-working natural oils: Argan, Avocado, Castor, Grapeseed, and MCT. Together, they soak into the hair and skin beneath to stop beard itch and dry flakes before they start. It leaves a light, clean sheen without feeling greasy.</p>

    <h3>How to use</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Apply a few drops to your palm and rub your hands together.</li>
      <li>Massage into your beard and skin beneath, starting at the roots and working outwards.</li>
      <li>Comb or brush through to style.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Give your beard the care it deserves. Grab a bottle today.</p>

    <ul class="actions">
      <li><a href="" class="button big">Order Now</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  
</BaseLayout>